{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VectaGuard: Zero</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Retro Vector Arcade Shooter with Modern Explosive Action.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VectaGuard:\u00a0Zero</strong> is a neon-drenched vertical shooter where glowing wireframe caverns explode with arcade action. Inspired by retro arcade shmups\u00a0<i>Gravitar</i>, <i>Caverns of Mars</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Defender</i>, this is the ultimate mash-up of old-school arcade intensity and modern over-the-top spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/22f453b436593b634e21a373ab8c730b.poster.avif?t=1773083988\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/22f453b436593b634e21a373ab8c730b.webm?t=1773083988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/22f453b436593b634e21a373ab8c730b.mp4?t=1773083988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pseudo-3D Vector Aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold glowing wireframe worlds bring glowing caverns and retro sci-fi worlds to life with a modern twist. Descend through treacherous caverns, enemy emplacements and dodge hazards out to reduce your health bar to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stackable Firepower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power-ups to enhance your ship with devastating weapons. Maximizing your damage-per-second is essential to succeeding in VectaGuard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Score Chasing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against yourself and global leaderboards. Learn the hidden methods to maximize your score through speed, damage output and raw action game skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Roots, Modern Edge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to feel like a lost classic arcade game, but polished with today's fluid controls, physics and visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/9192035623240445099d4f9b682c441c.poster.avif?t=1773083988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/9192035623240445099d4f9b682c441c.webm?t=1773083988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/extras/9192035623240445099d4f9b682c441c.mp4?t=1773083988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro-Future Dynamic Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulse-pounding synths, industrial rhythms and jungle beats meld together in a dynamic soundtrack that changes according to your playing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2892200?t=1773083988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/07d2e4e104cdd0d9435d03459e10786fc1d6deb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773083988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/bfa71fdc563142469ddf1b131e0c4b65fa43f5bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773083988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892200/bfa71fdc563142469ddf1b131e0c4b65fa43f5bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773083988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"